P6VertexQa"},{"text":"]]","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The connected components: two vertices are together when a chain of hyperedges joins them.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Components are ordered by their least vertex index and list their vertices in index order;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"an isolated vertex is alone, and an empty hyperedge joins nothing. No vertices, no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"components.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol"}}}